The family uses the exact planar \(L_1\) construction and forced schedule normal form from Sections 2 and 3.3 of the [paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.14357).

Key results:

- Shipping preset: `standard`, `n=125`, 502 robots.
- G1–G8 all pass.
- Structure-aware guessing: 0/200,000.
- Five adversarial attacks: 0/8 each.
- An initial `n=40` version was discarded because exact MRV search solved it cheaply.
- The revised exact MRV attack exhausted 100,000 nodes on all 8 gate seeds and 20 additional seeds.
- Official hardening verdict: `hardened`, with failures from Gemini, Claude, and GPT-5.6 Terra.
- Final interface, JSON schema, determinism, parser, and transcript checks pass.
